      "created_at": "2023-04-07T11:22:29.700Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A Challenging Chokepoint is making mayhem in the Maerynian Refuge. It’s up to Santa Guise, Termi-nation Unity, Expatriette and Void Guard Idealist to trounce this technological titan.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"plFwRFrDtFhxfdCCWAxXxwYH0U0\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1a96ff5582233aaada7144be7eb0d836dde28b8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 139 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>In theory anyway. In reality, after 5 attempts I haven’t even come close. I think my best shot came when the environment had out all the Squall-Guards and the Maerynian Lightning-dome to do 9 damage a turn. Which lasted until Chokepoint absorbed the entire environment.</p>\n<p>No mints here- but I could use some mints to wash out the horrible after taste in my mouth. This is a brutal week.</p>",
