      "username": "Omegatron",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omegatron/{size}/4904_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-04-07T13:08:59.980Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I minted this one, just thanks to the luck of the shuffle. Chokepoint just didn’t do much the whole game, though there was one environment turn where an unexpected microburst killed a golem and Chokepoint kept re-triggering until she killed Unity.</p>\n<p>Tactically, I just avoided deliberately destroying my own cards all game (no ongoings from Guise, no ammo from Expat, no using concepts with fragments under them, etc.).</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nImage</summary>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785\" title=\"20230405213902_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230405213902_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"bpPPvOlOkv92cVm8fuqrm38P2gl\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5003901256311133d90bbe9bbc2045b3b57bd785_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230405213902_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 498 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</details>",
