      "raw": "I minted this one, just thanks to the luck of the shuffle. Chokepoint just didn't do much the whole game, though there was one environment turn where an unexpected microburst killed a golem and Chokepoint kept re-triggering until she killed Unity.\n\nTactically, I just avoided deliberately destroying my own cards all game (no ongoings from Guise, no ammo from Expat, no using concepts with fragments under them, etc.).\n\n[details=\"Image\"]\n![20230405213902_1|690x388, 100%](upload://bpPPvOlOkv92cVm8fuqrm38P2gl.jpeg)\n[/details]",
