      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/5daacb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-04-08T23:48:43.501Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb\" title=\"Screen Shot 2023-04-08 at 3.03.27 PM\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb_2_690x451.jpeg\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2023-04-08 at 3.03.27 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"4F6rRojPjW21sYkKX2GEr3Myf0L\" width=\"690\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb_2_690x451.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb_2_1035x676.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb_2_1380x902.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/20ae2d0d1f352885ea963147be49885bba5509bb_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2023-04-08 at 3.03.27 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1257 287 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nMade an account to share my victory over this monstrosity.<br>\nMostly luck, combined with the Monster of Id/Karate Robot strategy. Two KRs and an additional feeder Concept meant that Better Punching was my MVP. I had enough Better Punching and  other damage one-shots come out that I didn’t even have to draw Bored Now. I lived a little dangerously by putting out guns and was able to finish her with Unload.</p>",
